WEBVTT

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:06.250
A Proposal for a Freshman Orientation Program
关于新生入学教育活动的建议

00:00:07.050 --> 00:00:17.120
To help freshmen adapt to their new environment and academic studies as quickly as possible, I would like to propose an orientation program at the start of the coming semester.
为了帮助新生尽快适应新环境和大学学习，我想建议在下学期开学时举办一次入学教育活动。

00:00:17.920 --> 00:00:22.440
The program will last one week, starting on the day after registration.
活动为期一周，从报到后的第二天开始。

00:00:23.240 --> 00:00:30.620
It will be organized by the Student Affairs Office with the help of student volunteers, and all freshmen are expected to take part.
活动将由学生事务处在学生志愿者的协助下组织，全体新生都要参加。

00:00:31.420 --> 00:00:35.460
Teachers from each department and senior students will also be invited.
各院系的老师和高年级学生也会受邀参加。

00:00:36.260 --> 00:00:39.110
The program will include a variety of activities.
活动将包括多种多样的内容。

00:00:39.910 --> 00:00:48.910
On the first day, freshmen will take a guided tour of the campus to become familiar with the library, laboratories, canteens and the medical center.
第一天，新生将在引导下参观校园，熟悉图书馆、实验室、食堂和医务室。

00:00:49.710 --> 00:00:56.010
Next, teachers will hold meetings to introduce the curriculum, credit requirements and effective study methods.
接下来，老师们会召开会议，介绍课程设置、学分要求和有效的学习方法。

00:00:56.810 --> 00:01:03.150
Then senior students will share tips on balancing study and social life and answer questions in small groups.
然后，高年级学生会分享兼顾学习和社交生活的诀窍，并分小组回答问题。

00:01:03.950 --> 00:01:08.180
Finally, a welcome party will be held so that freshmen can make new friends.
最后，将举行一场欢迎会，让新生结交新朋友。

00:01:08.980 --> 00:01:15.310
I am confident that this program will help freshmen settle in smoothly and get off to a good start in college.
我相信这项活动将帮助新生顺利适应大学生活，并在大学里开个好头。
